Not included
------------
- Inco Lightning (BUSL-1.1): read for results/phase4/INCO_MAPPING.md; no Inco code is in this repository.
- dilithium-py and the Rust ML-DSA and ML-KEM crates: fetched by their tools (pip or cargo) at the versions the
  reports name.
- The rest of fireblocks-labs/evm-ml-dsa-verifier (its Python reference, key preparation and fixtures): `make pq-drill`
  fetches the repository at cca262b5 for the drill's test signer, experiments/E4/pq/mldsa_tool.py.
- polyntt, the NTT that the verifier's Python reference imports: `make pq-drill` installs it with pip from
  ZKNoxHQ/NTT at 3ac5f5dc (assets/pythonref), as the verifier's pythonref/requirements.txt pins it. No licence file
  was found in that repository at that commit, so nothing of it is in this repository.

